{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-multicoloured-magnetic-tiles-2604-0055","content_id":"0ddb08c3-c639-4cf5-9bc8-b297fe7cf827","description":"Product Safety Report for Multicoloured Magnetic Tiles presenting a serious risk of asphyxiation.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a54ba3b9-dd92-4741-86ae-4e96fd8b792a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-12T15:44:23+01:00","id":"a54ba3b9-dd92-4741-86ae-4e96fd8b792a","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-06-12T15:44:23+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2c1b4715f2a70fac7e5ecf/2604-0055-product-safety-report-magnetic-tiles.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Multicoloured Magnetic Tiles</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of asphyxiation because the drawstring bag containing the magnetic tiles does not comply with BS EN 71-1 requirements.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Puzzles (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Yongkang Hongle Industry &amp; Trade Co. Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>MT100</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>X0022DLXR5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Multicoloured magnetic tiles in drawstring bag.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a54ba3b9-dd92-4741-86ae-4e96fd8b792a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2c1b4715f2a70fac7e5ecf/2604-0055-product-safety-report-magnetic-tiles.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of asphyxiation because the drawstring bag containing the magnetic tiles does not comply with BS EN 71-1 requirements. The opening of the bag exceeds the permitted size and incorporates a drawstring closure, meaning it could be placed over a child’s head and tightened. As the material is not sufficiently permeable, this would restrict airflow and may lead to asphyxiation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) \nRegulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0055</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-12T15:03:10Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-12","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-12T16:03:10+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-multicoloured-magnetic-tiles-2604-0055","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-multicoloured-magnetic-tiles